Cell["\<\
Figure 3. Newton polytope of P (top row) and Q (bottom row) for the trained \
moons classifier. The 3D upper hull (left) and the linear-piece partition of \
input space (right) are dual: 4 of P's 7 monomials and 5 of Q's 7 monomials \
realise a region. The rest are dominated everywhere and contribute nothing -- \
exactly the kind of redundancy we are about to exploit in \[Section]18.\
\>", "Text",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Helvetica",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,ExpressionUUID->"5b2a173c-a6c0-4995-9b3a-e0c1a1380f52"],

Cell["16.  Linear regions scale like n^2", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"dbb17ad7-23e6-415a-8841-6697de156096"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "By Zaslavsky's theorem, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[
   FormBox[
    TagBox["n",
     HoldForm],
    TraditionalForm],
   TraditionalForm,
   Editable->True]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "c72cec19-d387-4774-b28e-5e96c2653ecb"],
 " straight lines in general position in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[
   FormBox[
    TagBox[
     SuperscriptBox["R", "2"],
     HoldForm],
    TraditionalForm],
   TraditionalForm,
   Editable->True]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "a42e3047-7448-496a-8537-33ef78cabdeb"],
 " partition the plane into at most"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3a5f9752-dc7a-4205-8490-91a73481a0ba"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[
  FormBox[
   TagBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Z", "(", "n", ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
     RowBox[{"1", "+", "n", "+", 
      TemplateBox[{"n", "2"},
       "Binomial"]}], "\[LongEqual]", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox["n", "2"], "+", "n", "+", "2"}], ")"}]}]}],
    HoldForm],
   TraditionalForm],
  TraditionalForm,
  Editable->True]], "DisplayFormula",
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"7b398a54-a8de-48aa-87e5-15b08dfa0f94"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "regions. That is the Zhang-Naitzat-Lim upper bound for a 1-hidden-layer \
ReLU classifier with 2D input. We sweep ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[
   FormBox[
    TagBox[
     RowBox[{"n", "\[Element]", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
       "2", ",", "4", ",", "8", ",", "16", ",", "32", ",", "64", ",", "96"}], 
       "}"}]}],
     HoldForm],
    TraditionalForm],
   TraditionalForm,
   Editable->True]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "1cb3d231-87e3-443a-97da-e82ecf12fd2e"],
 " on two-moons (3 seeds each), count realised activation patterns on a 400\
\[Times]400 grid, and compare to the bound."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fac7584b-80ea-4e3d-9b3d-b4299f8291e9"],

